Value SLOT (\d+)
Value CPU_ID (\d+)
Value SYSTEM_CPU (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value DATAPLANE_CPU (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value CPU_5_SEC (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value CPU_1_MIN (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value CPU_5_MIN (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value MAX_CPU (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^Slot:\s*${SLOT}\s+CPU:\s*${CPU_ID}\s*$$
  ^CPU\s+utilization\s+statistics\s+at\s+.+$$
  ^System\s+CPU\s+Using\s+Percentage\s*:\s*${SYSTEM_CPU}%\s*$$
  ^Dataplane\s+CPU\s+Using\s+Percentage\s*:\s*${DATAPLANE_CPU}%\s*$$
  ^CPU\s+utilization\s+for\s+five\s+seconds:\s*${CPU_5_SEC}%[,]?\s+one\s+minute:\s*${CPU_1_MIN}%[,]?\s+five\s+minutes:\s*${CPU_5_MIN}%.?\s*$$
  ^Max\s+CPU\s+Usage\s*:\s*${MAX_CPU}%\s*$$ -> Record
  ^-+$$
